      "parameters": {
        "content": "# RSS Read Node\n1. Manual Trigger \n2. RSS Read Node\n-- Contains an RSS link with specified search terms obtained from PubMed.\n-- Pulls 15 most recent pharmacological research on Ketamine (as JSON).\n3. Loop-Over-Items + Post + Wait loop\n--  Can't post 15 items to Discord because of rate limits.\n--  15 posts separated into batches of 1, posted 1 at a time with 0.5s in between posts.\n3. Discord POST\n-- REST API (POST) node \n-- Posts to Discord server via a webhook\n-- JSON is used in body of REST request\n4. Final Output: \n-- 15 posts in a Discord server",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 1648,
        "color": 5
      },
