      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# RSS Feed Node\n1. RSS Feed Trigger\n-- Runs every minute\n-- Keeps track of previously posted items and only posts new items that hit the feed\n-- RSS link is still set to 15 so maximum output here is 15\n2. Loop-Over-Items + Post + Wait loop\n-- Same deal as above, to work around rate limits.\n3. Final Output\n-- 0-15 posts contingent on new articles entering PubMed matching the RSS links\nsearch terms",
